        "notes": "**Strategy**: Farm at a distance.\n\nI usually start with  [Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) . The two extra shurikens makes the left-click more reliable. Sometimes you also nail a satisfying 5 headshots from afar for surprising burst.\n\n[Cybernetic Speed](item_6e88739f-7e7e-4e01-ba55-2e3c62c949ec) is less reliable now as you don't have other items to make it shine. \n\nBuild Weapon Power (wp) and Attack Speed (as). Survivability is not super important, you're quite insulated playing near team or from medium range angles.\n\nIf you're versus a heavy ranged comp (Soldier, Zen, Ashe etc.) then you should have played traditional melee build instead.",
